@rekram1-node thanks for the reply! I updated the steps above (just adding openrouter provider & API key).

I dont think so, I use another model Grok 4 Fast (free) - OpenRouter working fine.

I have another workaround using `deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3.1:free` here the opencode.json in local project.

```JSON
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "model": "deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3.1:free",
  "provider": {
    "openrouter": {
      "models": {
        "deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3.1:free": {}
      }
    }
  }
}
```

I dont change global opencode.json
I really loves it when deepseek-chat-v3.1:free works!

